Capathy

Capathy integrates with Mandiant capa (https://github.com/mandiant/capa),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The integration patch contains modifications to capa source files and retains
upstream copyright notices. New adapter files retain their existing notices.
The full upstream engine is downloaded separately and is not included in the
current Capathy source tree or Python distribution.

Go dependencies include separately licensed Tree-sitter grammars, ADK, SQLite,
and their dependencies. See the Go modules and component READMEs.
